apps/2250370/extras/8a6c0523ab18673207bafa4a7b21018d.avif?t=1725035257\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250370/extras/95e0d69e99b1f477f84376543c9cb17e.poster.avif?t=1725035257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250370/extras/95e0d69e99b1f477f84376543c9cb17e.webm?t=1725035257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250370/extras/95e0d69e99b1f477f84376543c9cb17e.mp4?t=1725035257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250370/extras/79b41d32af9c3b0866505b74c2a223a1.avif?t=1725035257\" /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></strong><br><strong>Turn-Based Clan Warfare:</strong><br>Engage in turn-based battles against rival clans.<br><strong>Resource Management:</strong><br>Secure your influence through the accumulation of gold, stock and shares in critical resources such as Petrol, Water, Electricity, and Ammunition.<br><strong>Dynamic Gameplay: </strong><br>Experience random in-game events after each round.<br><strong>Side Hustle: </strong><br>Side missions like bird hunts and loot discoveries.<br><strong>Economic Strategy:</strong><br>Acquire gold by harvesting scattered resources like wood, metal, and fabric, then invest in items, upgrades, stocks and shares to propel your clan to victory.<br><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong><br>Make tactical decisions even outside your turn, balancing personal actions like building and gathering<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Back 4 more was developed by a solo developer under a year to test the concept of the game</h2></strong>",
